      "en": "For, behold, the wicked bend their bows. They set their arrows on the strings, that they may shoot in darkness at the upright in heart.",
      "ko": "악인이 활을 당기고 살을 시위에 먹임이여 마음이 바른 자를 어두운데서 쏘려 하는도다",
      "source_text_hash": "fdb2d2183461dda9b37119d22c9e4b7d8d56fa405434dc8c8800d3ced2bb8dcb",
      "translation_text_hash": "b21236b43e501344417d75a997ed2477b94b238534d01fd25065dbc1f52c7931",
